  "notes": "Modified cash basis. Governmental receipts/disbursements from Total Governmental Funds column (p5); fund balance roll-forward 253,110 + 420,116 - 332,424 - 99,102 = 241,700. No cash roll-forward printed: ending_cash is governmental funds balance sheet cash and cash equivalents 219,652 (p4, incl. Street Fund restricted cash 46,051); county treasurer cash 1,034 is a separate line; certificates of deposit 21,014 in ending_investments; beginning cash not printed (null). Business-type from proprietary funds modified cash statement Total column (p7); total expenses 275,733 ties to Statement of Activities (p2). General Fund detail from the departmental combining statement (pp11-12, more detailed than the General Fund budget schedule p9, which is therefore not recorded); General Fund budget schedule shows general government 132,540 = combining General column incl. debt payments. Department transfer column (pp11-12) nets to the fund's transfers out 99,102. Street Fund lines from its budget schedule (p10); lines with no actual (Loan proceeds budget 674,409, Capital outlay budget 756,900, Transfers budget 40,000) not recorded. Water/Sewer have no schedules, so no detail for them. Cemetery is printed under Public works; detail uses health/welfare. Balance sheet: governmental lines from governmental funds balance sheet (totals equal government-wide 241,700), business-type lines from Statement of Net Position business-type column; totals from p1 Total column. Read pages 1-12 of 12"
